<div><p>Se testeaza adaugarea de piese/produse</p>
</div><a name="toc_tc23915"></a><p>&nbsp;</p><div> <table class="tc" width="90%" ><tr><th colspan="4">Test Case Prj232-15: ECP-Valid_Test_Case&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 80%;">[Version  : 1]</span></th></tr>
